<title>UK: Banco BCN sets $100 mln structured eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco BCN sets $100 mln structured eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BCN</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    08.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    **</p>
<p> SPREAD     AROUND 230 BP TO THE THREE YEAR PUT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A CALL AND PUT OPTION ON 08.AUG.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
